Third-party assets bundled with cacophony
==========================================

sh_hrir_order_1.wav
-------------------
A 4-channel, 48 kHz, 16-bit, 256-sample order-1 spherical-harmonic HRIR
(Head-Related Impulse Response) used by the FOA -> binaural decoder
(FoaDecoderEffect). The four channels are the SH-domain HRIR rows used by the
WY / ZX stereo-ConvolverNode decode graph (see src/effects.ts).

